        "study_id": "S1",
        "part_id": null,
        "statement": "Modified Fedorov designs implemented in Ngene or SAS with attribute level overlap are recommended for EQ-5D-5L valuation DCEs, because they reduce attribute non-attendance and improve respondent engagement.",
